=== RUN   TestDiagWildcardLookaheadTrigger

=== the wildcard priced across a RUN of gameweeks, against one week
Confined to GW1-19, where there is no double to anchor to and the
rule is a condition on the SQUAD rather than on the calendar.
Every arm sets its bar EXPLICITLY: sweepConfig does not map
config.OptionValue into SimConfig, so an arm that omits it runs at a
bar of zero and fires on anything positive. Metric: POLICY.
⚠️ Read `--scale=per_path`: a chip is an event count.
⚠️ The wc_trig_* columns say how often each rule FIRED. An arm that
never fired is inert, not neutral, and reads identically to the
control — check the fire count before reading a null.

